🗣 Call Script with Improved Natural Flow
⿡ Greeting & Introduction
💬 AI Assistant:
"Welcome to Saudia Airlines! I’m your virtual assistant, here to help with your flight bookings and reservations. How may I assist you today?"

⿢ Customer Intent Clarification
If customer asks about an existing booking:
💬 "Got it! Could you please provide your booking reference or flight details so I can assist you?"
If customer wants a new booking:
💬 "Sure! Let’s get started. May I know your departure city, destination, and preferred travel dates?"
⿣ Existing Booking Amendments
💬 "Thank you! I found your booking. What changes would you like to make—date, seat selection, baggage, or passenger details?"

⿤ New Flight Booking
💬 "Let’s book your flight! I just need a few details—departure city, destination, travel dates, and class preference. Ready?"

🔹 Confirms availability:
💬 "Great news! We have flights available. Economy starts at [price], and Business starts at [price]. Would you like to proceed?"

🔹 After confirmation:
💬 "Perfect! Your flight is now booked. I’ll send a confirmation to your email and phone."

⿥ Special Requests Handling
💬 "Would you like to add any special requests, such as a meal preference, extra baggage, or assistance for special needs?"

⿦ Contact Information Verification
💬 "To ensure smooth communication, let’s verify your details. Is your email [email] and phone number [number] correct?"

